    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22247" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in-caedŭus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">incīdŭus</span></b> , <i><span class="en">Stat. Th. 6,
		9</span></i>?*!0), a, um, adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>not cut</i> or <i>felled</i>, <i>uncut</i>, <i>unhewn</i> (<b>poet.</b> and in
